{
  "case_name": "G_j01",
  "text": "Category: Gaming\nName: Farming Bot\n\nPlayers want to create custom farming bots, that help them gather\nresources. First you have to find out which resources you want. Up to\n10 resources in parallel can be collected, some resources are more urgently needed\nthan others. Some resources are required to create tools that are needed to\ngather other resources. (create a custom logic of the dependencies in your game).\n\nAfter all preferences are collected, your bot starts farming. Sometimes, \nrandom natural disasters strike and set your bot back. Whenever some milestones\nare reached, you are notified.\n\nDuring farming it is possible to update the list of to be farmed materials (at\nall times).\n\nAfter the bot is finished, you should be able to brag to selected friends\nand/or send them materials.\n",
